{"order":171,"paras":["Till slut är det oerhört viktigt att inte utgå från att AI-utvecklingen har stannat av. Vi måste utgå från att den snabba utvecklingstakten kan fortsätta i ytterligare ett antal år, kanske fram till 2030. Det betyder att vi också måste tänka igenom vad kraftfull AI kan innebära för samhälle och individer, och vidta de åtgärder som behövs för att kunna möta förändringar."],"para_tokens":[["Till","slut","är","det","oerhört","viktigt","att","inte","utgå","från","att","AI-utvecklingen","har","stannat","av.","Vi","måste","utgå","från","att","den","snabba","utvecklingstakten","kan","fortsätta","i","ytterligare","ett","antal","år,","kanske","fram","till","2030.","Det","betyder","att","vi","också","måste","tänka","igenom","vad","kraftfull","AI","kan","innebära","för","samhälle","och","individer,","och","vidta","de","åtgärder","som","behövs","för","att","kunna","möta","förändringar."]],"words":[{"t":"Till","s":0.0,"e":0.24},{"t":"slut","s":0.24,"e":0.56},{"t":"är","s":0.56,"e":0.7},{"t":"det","s":0.7,"e":0.82},{"t":"oerhört","s":0.82,"e":1.24},{"t":"viktigt","s":1.24,"e":1.6},{"t":"att","s":1.6,"e":1.8},{"t":"inte","s":1.8,"e":2.06},{"t":"utgå","s":2.06,"e":2.52},{"t":"från","s":2.52,"e":2.7},{"t":"att","s":2.7,"e":2.86},{"t":"AI-utvecklingen","s":2.86,"e":3.16},{"t":"har","s":3.76,"e":3.96},{"t":"stannat","s":3.96,"e":4.32},{"t":"av.","s":4.32,"e":4.5},{"t":"Vi","s":5.14,"e":5.22},{"t":"måste","s":5.22,"e":5.44},{"t":"utgå","s":5.44,"e":5.88},{"t":"från","s":5.88,"e":6.06},{"t":"att","s":6.06,"e":6.2},{"t":"den","s":6.2,"e":6.34},{"t":"snabba","s":6.34,"e":6.74},{"t":"utvecklingstakten","s":6.74,"e":7.8},{"t":"kan","s":7.8,"e":8.0},{"t":"fortsätta","s":8.0,"e":8.5},{"t":"i","s":8.5,"e":8.74},{"t":"ytterligare","s":8.74,"e":9.28},{"t":"ett","s":9.28,"e":9.46},{"t":"antal","s":9.46,"e":9.74},{"t":"år,","s":9.74,"e":10.0},{"t":"kanske","s":10.58,"e":10.82},{"t":"fram","s":10.82,"e":11.06},{"t":"till","s":11.06,"e":11.3},{"t":"2030.","s":11.3,"e":12.12},{